{"path":"io/ios_base/event_callback","title":"std::ios_base::event_callback","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::ios_base::</span>event_callback","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/ios_base/event_callback","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"The type of function callbacks that can be registered using register_callback() to be called on specific events.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">typedef</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>event_callback <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> event type, ios_base<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> ios, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> index <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The type of function callbacks that can be registered using <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/register_callback\">register_callback()</a></span> to be called on specific events.\n</p><p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">type</span></code> is a value of type <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/event\"><code>ios_base::event</code></a> which indicates the type of the event that will invoke this callback.\n</p><p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ios</span></code> refers to the stream object for which the callback is invoked: <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> is passed as the argument when callbacks are invoked by <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base\">std::ios_base</a></span> and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ios\">std::basic_ios</a></span> member functions.\n</p><p><code cla