n callbacks that can be registered using register_callback() to be called on specific events."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"copyfmt","note":"copies formatting information"},{"label":"imbue","note":"sets locale"},{"label":"(destructor)","note":"destructs the object"},{"label":"register_callback","note":"registers event callback function"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":121,"codeBlockCount":0}
